# Elas il-Kor's death trigger sees the creatures that die in the same event as Elas (CR 603.10a, ruling 2022-09-09): Bot2's
# Pyroclasm kills Elas (2/2) and two Eager Cadets together, and Elas's ability triggers once for each Cadet, so Bot2 loses
# exactly 2 (and not for Elas itself: "another"). Bot1 gains 1 for each Cadet entering.

